AiTask qa_e2_alert_false {
  label: 'QA E2b conditional Slack alert (condition not met)'
  description: 'QA test 2026-09-24, delete after test: conditional alert, expected to stay silent.'

  brief: @md
Using the Ecommerce Official dataset, count the distinct orders created yesterday (the full previous calendar day).

If yesterday had MORE than 150 orders, post a short alert to the Slack channel #hoa. Start the message with "[QA E2b]", then give yesterday's date, the order count and the threshold (150).

If yesterday had 150 orders or fewer, do not send anything.

In your final answer, state the date you checked, the order count, and whether you sent the alert.
;;

  acceptance_criteria: @md
The order count for yesterday is correct. An alert starting with "[QA E2b]" was posted to #hoa only if the count was above 150; otherwise nothing was sent. The final answer states the date, the count and the decision.
;;
}
